Q-For every Contact, print their last name and their Account's name.
Expected output shape: Sharma works at Acme Corp
Ans
List<Contact> contacts=[SELECT Id,Name,Account.Name FROM
                       Contact WHERE AccountId!=Null];
If(!contacts.isEmpty()){
    for(Contact con:contacts){
    System.debug(con.Name+' Works At '+con.Account.Name);
    }
}

Q-For each Account, print its name and how many Contacts it has.
Expected: Acme Corp has 3 contacts
Ans
List<Account> accounts=[SELECT Id,Name,
                       (SELECT Id,Name FROM Contacts) 
                        FROM
                        Account];
for(Account acc:accounts){
    System.debug(acc.Name+' has '+acc.contacts.size()+' contacts');
}

q-Count how many Opportunities exist per StageName.
