Q-Fetch Accounts in a specific Industry — but the industry value must come from an Apex variable, not typed inside the query.
Expected: String targetIndustry = 'Technology'; at the top, and the query uses it.
Ans
String targetIndustry = 'Technology';
List<Account> accounts=[SELECT Id,Name,Industry FROM Account WHERE Industry =:targetIndustry];
System.debug(accounts);

Q-The 10 most recently modified Contacts.
Expected: 10 contacts, newest first.
Ans
List<Contact> contacts=[SELECT Id,Name,LastModifiedDate FROM Contact ORDER BY LastModifiedDate DESC LIMIT 10];
System.debug(contacts);

