Q-Grab 2–3 real Account Ids from your org (copy them from any query's results), put them in a Set<Id>, and fetch all their Contacts in ONE query.
Expected: a list of contacts belonging to those accounts.
Ans
List<Account> accounts =[SELECT Id FROM Account WHERE Industry='Energy'];
Set<Id> accIds= new Set<Id>();
for(Account acc:accounts){
    accIds.add(acc.id);
}
List<Contact> contacts=[SELECT Id, Name,AccountId FROM Contact WHERE AccountId IN:accIds];
System.debug(contacts);








